{
  "title": "ECS / EKS / Fargate · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "컨테이너 실행을 관리하는 ECS·EKS와 실행 용량 방식인 Fargate를 구분합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span> / EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span> / Fargate</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#guide-1\">관리 서비스와 실행 환경 선택</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#guide-2\">이미지를 서비스로 배포하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>18 / 62</span></div><h1>ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span> / EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span> / Fargate</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>컨테이너는 <strong>애플리케이션과 실행에 필요한 환경을 하나로 묶어 배포하는 방식</strong>입니다. 여러 컨테이너를 어디서 실행하고 몇 개 유지할지 관리하는 서비스로 ECS와 EKS가 있습니다.</p><p>ECS는 AWS의 컨테이너 관리 서비스이고, EKS는 Kubernetes<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>를 사용하는 관리형 서비스입니다. Fargate를 선택하면 컨테이너용 서버를 직접 관리하는 부담을 줄일 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"amazon-ecs\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"task-definition-task-and-service\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"amazon-eks\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aws-fargate\"></span><h2>관리 서비스와 실행 환경 선택</h2><p><strong>ECS 또는 EKS:</strong> AWS 중심의 간단한 운영을 원하면 ECS를, Kubernetes 도구와 운영 방식을 사용하려면 EKS를 검토합니다.</p><p><strong>Fargate 또는 EC2:</strong> Fargate에서는 컨테이너의 자원 요구를 지정하고 실행합니다. EC2 기반 실행은 호스트 구성과 용량을 직접 제어할 수 있어 특수한 요구나 운영 방식에 맞춰 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ec2-compute-and-capacity-providers\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"eks-auto-mode-and-managed-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"amazon-ecr\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"networking-and-load-balancing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"task-role-and-execution-role\"></span><h2>이미지를 서비스로 배포하기</h2><p>컨테이너 이미지는 ECR 같은 저장소에 보관합니다. ECS에서는 태스크 정의에 이미지, CPU, 메모리, 포트 등을 지정하고 서비스로 필요한 태스크 수를 유지합니다.</p><p>사용자 요청은 로드 밸런서로 전달하고 처리량에 따라 컨테이너 수를 조절합니다. 애플리케이션의 AWS 권한과 이미지 내려받기·로그 전송에 필요한 실행 권한을 구분합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>컨테이너 애플리케이션 배포</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>이미지 저장</strong><span>ECR 등에 실행 이미지</span></li><li><strong>서비스 정의</strong><span>ECS 또는 EKS</span></li><li><strong>컨테이너 실행</strong><span>Fargate 또는 EC2</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">컨테이너를 관리할 서비스와 그 컨테이너가 실행될 용량 방식을 각각 선택합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>API를 컨테이너 이미지로 만들어 ECR에 저장합니다. ECS 서비스를 Fargate로 실행하고 ALB를 연결해 서버 운영 없이 여러 태스크에 요청을 분산합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>Kubernetes</strong> — 컨테이너의 배포, 확장, 상태 복구 등을 관리하는 오픈 소스 플랫폼입니다. EKS는 Kubernetes의 제어 영역 운영을 관리해줍니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonECS/latest/developerguide/Welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon Elastic Container Service? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/eks/latest/userguide/what-is-eks.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon EKS? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonECR/latest/userguide/what-is-ecr.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon Elastic Container Registry? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q037/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q037\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q037\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q037</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q037/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants a managed control plane while retaining the Kubernetes API and ecosystem. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q037\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon ECS only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q037\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q037\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Fargate only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q037\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EKS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">EKS</a>는 관리형 Kubernetes다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">Fargate</a>는 컨테이너 실행 인프라 선택지다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">ECS / EKS / Fargate</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q038\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q038\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q038</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q038/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company runs ECS tasks and wants to reduce EC2 host patching and capacity management. Which compute option should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q038\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q038\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Fargate</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q038\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q038\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">ECS</a> 서비스를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">Fargate</a> 용량으로 실행할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">ECS / EKS / Fargate</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q031\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q031\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q031</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q031/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to add EC2 instances as web traffic changes and replace unhealthy instances. Which feature should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q031\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS snapshots only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 원하는 용량과 확장 정책, 상태 확인을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1,2\" data-question=\"Q084\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q084\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q084</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q084/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO components allow a stateless web tier to scale with demand and withstand an Availability Zone failure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EC2 instance with an Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer with targets in multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling configured for multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume shared from one AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudTrail queries only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 용량을 유지·확장하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>가 건강한 대상으로 요청을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q032\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q032\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">이전 용어 <b>EC2 Purchasing Options</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">다음 용어 <b>Edge Location</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
